{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"سنن ابن ماجه","section":{"12":"The Chapters on Business Transactions"},"section_detail":{"12":{"hadithnumber_first":2137,"hadithnumber_last":2307,"arabicnumber_first":2137,"arabicnumber_last":2307,"name_native":"أبواب المعاملات التجارية"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2222,"arabicnumber":2222,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن يحيى، حدثنا عبد الصمد، حدثنا شعبة، عن محارب بن دثار، عن جابر بن عبد الله، قال قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \" اذا وزنتم فارجحوا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":12,"hadith":86}}]}